  "_collider_reaches_the_ground": "The lower box goes down to y = 0 rather than stopping at the barrel, and that is load-bearing rather than cosmetic. A `Walker`'s body origin is what its feet are measured from \u2014 `Locomotion.step` plants against the transform it is handed \u2014 so a creature whose collision stops short of its soles settles that far into the ground, and then every foot is asked to reach *upward* for a surface above its own ideal position and fails. `Walker` warns about it now; this is the asset that taught it to.",
