  "_stats": "`max_speed` 14 is the top of the gallop band in the gait table below rather than a number invented for the stat block. If the two disagreed, the rider would be able to ask for a speed the legs have no gait for, and the horse would skate \u2014 which is the failure C2 spent a day on and is worth not reintroducing through a different door.",
