  "_seat": "One seat, and it is the `driver` \u2014 a rider steers. `eye` is 20 modules up and 2 forward, which is on the horse's back above the barrel rather than at its origin: the camera goes where the pack said, because no formula gets a saddle and a lorry cab both right. `controls` names the bones the rider's hands reach for, which C6's hands-on-controls IK reads \u2014 reins would be their own parts on a tacked horse, and neck and head are what this one has."
